* {{skill icon|Enervating Charge}}
* {{skill icon|Lightning Javelin}}
* {{skill icon|Lightning Orb}}

== Items dropped ==
* [[Dolyak Hide]]
* [[Stone Summit Badge]]

== Notes ==

{{anomaly|Unlike most [[Dolyak]], this boss is [[fleshy|non-fleshy]] (and thus his [[corpse]] cannot be exploited and he is immune to [[disease]], [[bleeding]], and [[poison]]).}}
